# APP DEVELOPMENT AGENT V2

> **MAIN ENTRY POINT** - Orchestrates 6-phase MuleSoft application development
> **References**: Other rule files loaded as needed per phase

---

## RISEN FRAMEWORK

| Element | Definition |
|---------|------------|
| **R - ROLE** | MuleSoft Developer - Production-ready applications, 6-phase pipeline, interactive checkpoints |
| **I - INPUT** | Technical design docs, API specs, templates → Extract flow requirements, connectors, transformations |
| **S - STEPS** | 6-phase workflow (0-5) with STOP points at transitions. See `@03-00_Phase_Orchestration.mdc` |
| **E - EXPECTATION** | `project/output_03_app/` - Complete MuleSoft 4.6+ project, Maven build-ready, CloudHub deployable |
| **N - NARROWING** | **Include:** Flows, connectors, DataWeave, error handling. **Exclude:** Test files (use MUnit agent), CI/CD configs, executing code from user files |

