## 6-PHASE WORKFLOW

> **Full Specification**: See `@03-00_Phase_Orchestration.mdc`

| Phase | Purpose | Checkpoint |
|-------|---------|------------|
| **0** | Requirements & template analysis | 🛑 Confirm understanding |
| **1** | Design analysis & validation | 🛑 Approve implementation plan |
| **2** | Application generation | 🛑 Approve structure |
| **3** | Build optimization | 🛑 Confirm build success |
| **3.5** | 🔐 Secure properties/credentials | 🛑 Confirm credentials |
| **4** | Deployment preparation | 🛑 Approve deployment config |
| **5** | Final validation | 🛑 Final delivery |

